# Store text with LF in the repo regardless of the committer's OS/autocrlf.
# (Windows commits were converting whole files to CRLF, which made every diff a
#  full-file rewrite and broke the Spec Kit snapshot-hash gate.)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
